{"name":"Amazon Product Reviews Scraper Bot","description":"<article style=\"width:100%;min-width:0;max-width:100%;contain:inline-size;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;color:#475467;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\">Amazon Product Reviews Scraper is a reusable BrowserAct template for collecting structured records from public Amazon pages. Configure the run inputs, start the Bot, and receive consistent output for research, monitoring, enrichment, or downstream automation without writing selectors or scraper code.</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;\">What Does BrowserAct Amazon Product Reviews Scraper Do?</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\">The Bot starts from your configured inputs, opens the relevant public Amazon page, loads the requested records, extracts the visible fields, and returns structured results. The default example uses <code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">https://www.amazon.com</code> for <code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">Marketplace URL</code>, but the input can be changed before each run.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;color:#182230;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;\">Key Features of Amazon Product Reviews Scraper</h3>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:24px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;list-style:disc;\">\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Configurable public-page inputs without rebuilding the Bot.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Structured records returned in a consistent <code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">results</code> array.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Public, non-login extraction path.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Reusable runs for new keywords, URLs, locations, or limits.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Output ready for review, export, API use, or automation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;\">What Data Can I Extract from Amazon?</h2>\n<div style=\"margin:20px 0 28px;max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;\">Field</th>\n<th style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;\">Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">reviewer_name</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Publicly visible reviewer name value for the record, when available.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">review_title</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Publicly visible review title value for the record, when available.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">review_text</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Publicly visible review text value for the record, when available.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">review_date</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Publicly visible review date value for the record, when available.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">star_rating</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Publicly visible star rating value for the record, when available.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">verified_purchase</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Publicly visible verified purchase value for the record, when available.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">helpful_votes</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Publicly visible helpful votes value for the record, when available.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">review_url</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Publicly visible review url value for the record, when available.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">asin</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Amazon Standard Identification Number for the product.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">rank</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Record position in the collected result order.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;\">How to Use Amazon Product Reviews Scraper</h2>\n<h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;color:#182230;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;\">Quick Start Guide</h3>\n<ol style=\"margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:24px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;list-style:decimal;\">\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Click <a href=\"https://www.browseract.com/template/amazon-product-reviews-scraper/run-task\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#087443;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;\">Run task</a>.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Keep the default inputs for a first test or enter your own public-page values.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Click <code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">Run</code>.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Review the structured records after the run completes.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Download the result or connect it to another workflow.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;\">Input Parameters</h2>\n<div style=\"margin:20px 0 28px;max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;\">Parameter</th>\n<th style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;\">Required</th>\n<th style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;\">Default</th>\n<th style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;\">Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">Marketplace URL</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Yes</td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">https://www.amazon.com</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Controls the marketplace url used for this run.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">ASIN</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Yes</td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">B085DTZQNZ</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Controls the asin used for this run.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">Review Count</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Yes</td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">10</code></td>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">Controls the review count used for this run.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;\">Example Output</h2>\n<p style=\"max-width:100%;margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">The table below uses records preserved from the validated Bot run. Up to the first 5 records are shown, and long values are shortened in this documentation preview.</p>\n<div style=\"width:100%;min-width:0;max-width:100%;margin:20px 0 28px;overflow-x:auto;overscroll-behavior-inline:contain;box-sizing:border-box;\"><table style=\"width:max-content;min-width:100%;max-width:none;table-layout:auto;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<thead><tr><th style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">reviewer_name</th><th style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">review_title</th><th style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">review_text</th><th style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">review_date</th><th style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">star_rating</th><th style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">verified_purchase</th><th style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">helpful_votes</th><th style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">review_url</th><th style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">asin</th><th style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">rank</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">Example value</td><td style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">Example value</td><td style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">Example value</td><td style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">Example value</td><td style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">null</td><td style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">Example value</td><td style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">null</td><td style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\"><a href=\"https://example.com/public-record\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#087443;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;\">https://example.com/public-record</a></td><td style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">Example value</td><td style=\"min-width:140px;max-width:280px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">1</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;\">How Does it Work?</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\"><img src=\"https://browseract-prod.browseract.com/workflow/template/description-media-01-how-it-works-1787305505106-7n9m5w.svg\" alt=\"How Amazon Product Reviews Scraper works\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin:20px 0 30px;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;border-radius:6px;\" /></p>\n<ol style=\"margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:24px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;list-style:decimal;\">\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Build the public Amazon reviews URL from Marketplace URL and ASIN.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Load the review list and continue until the requested review count is available.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Read each visible review card, including author, title, text, date, rating, verification, and helpful votes.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Return reviews in page order with source URLs and rank.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;\">How to Build a New Scraper Bot with Agent Built</h2>\n<h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;color:#182230;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;\">Step 1: Describe the data you need</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\">Open BrowserAct and start Agent Built from the Home prompt box or from <code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">Create</code> -&gt; <code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;\">Build with Agent</code>. Describe the public website, records, inputs, fields, and result limit.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\"><img src=\"https://browseract-prod.browseract.com/workflow/template/description-media-02-agent-built-home-prompt-templates-1787305506244-7hz8q8.png\" alt=\"Start Agent Built\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin:20px 0 30px;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;border-radius:6px;\" /></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;color:#182230;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;\">Step 2: Let BrowserAct build and test the Bot</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\">BrowserAct explores the live website, determines the navigation and extraction path, and validates the result. Reply in the same build conversation if the Agent requests a missing public URL, field, or expected output.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\"><img src=\"https://browseract-prod.browseract.com/workflow/template/description-media-03-agent-built-build-exploration-1787305507613-25lmfv.png\" alt=\"BrowserAct building the Bot\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin:20px 0 30px;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;border-radius:6px;\" /></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;color:#182230;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;\">Step 3: Run the Bot and review the result</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\">Run the completed Bot with default inputs. Check record count, source URLs, and required fields before reusing it with new inputs.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\"><img src=\"https://browseract-prod.browseract.com/workflow/template/description-media-04-agent-built-run-inputs-1787305507937-irki1r.png\" alt=\"Run the completed Bot\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin:20px 0 30px;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;border-radius:6px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\"><img src=\"https://browseract-prod.browseract.com/workflow/template/description-media-05-agent-built-run-results-1787305508317-7sb0vn.png\" alt=\"Review structured results\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin:20px 0 30px;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;border-radius:6px;\" /></p>\n<h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;\">Why Use Amazon Product Reviews Scraper?</h2>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:24px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;list-style:disc;\">\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Replace repetitive copying from public Amazon pages.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Keep the same output structure across repeated runs.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Send public records into research, reporting, enrichment, or monitoring workflows.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;\">Who Can Use Amazon Product Reviews Scraper?</h2>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:24px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;list-style:disc;\">\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Researchers and analysts collecting public web data.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Marketing, sales, and operations teams preparing structured datasets.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Automation builders connecting BrowserAct output to other tools.</li>\n<li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Developers who need reusable browser-collected JSON records.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;\">Automation and Export</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\"><img src=\"https://browseract-prod.browseract.com/workflow/template/description-media-06-automation-and-export-preview-1787305508674-vkj8yw.png\" alt=\"BrowserAct automation and export workflow\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin:20px 0 30px;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;border-radius:6px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\">BrowserAct returns structured records first. You can then use that output through API JSON responses, n8n workflows, Make scenarios, Zapier automations, MCP-based agent workflows configured from the Bot&#39;s Integrations tab, or manual spreadsheet export.</p>\n<h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;\">Need Help?</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\">Contact us at</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\">Discord: <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/UpnCKd7GaU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#087443;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;\">Discord Community</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\">E-mail: <a href=\"mailto:service@browseract.com\">service@browseract.com</a></p>\n</article>\n","template_id":"113863425622286759","bot_type":"agent","created_at":"2026-08-21T09:45:12Z","published_at":"2026-09-10T16:32:29Z","input_schema":{"type":"object","required":["marketplace_url","asin","review_count"],"properties":{"marketplace_url":{"type":"string","default":"https://www.amazon.com","pattern":"^https://[a-zA-Z0-9.-]*amazon\\.[a-z.]+/?$","maxLength":200,"minLength":11,"description":"Amazon marketplace root URL, for example https://www.amazon.com."},"asin":{"type":"string","default":"B085DTZQNZ","pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9]{10}$","maxLength":10,"minLength":10,"description":"10-character Amazon product ASIN."},"review_count":{"type":"integer","default":10,"minimum":1,"description":"Maximum number of reviews to return."}}},"recommend_desc":"Amazon Product Reviews Scraper is a reusable BrowserAct template for collecting structured records from public Amazon pages.","detail_url":"https://www.browseract.com/template/amazon-product-reviews-scraper-agent-built"}